    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Certo Salina",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100710007826762505949/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIW4e-FM7RBzPES2ioy8NfrQZcFFy91Zd-1AUDopJrGHJAoPw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "We have ordered takeout a few times from here. It was always fresh, hot and delicious.\nThey now have a new recipe for their pizza crust which was amazing!\nOnce I ordered a sandwich that came with fries, I never got you my sandwich that day as I could not stop eating the fries!  Crispy and not greasy. Yum!",
        "time": 1764186641,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Julie Craig",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102710464643634986162/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLA4ycIod3ltRL6ZOdD1QAUIGaSF8f4JC_BV7LjFcHCVVWM7PI=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "Delicious pizza!!! We had one all dressed and one vegetarian pizza, both amazing. Steak and pepperoni sub was excellent too, loved the sub roll/bun. Fast delivery as well.",
        "time": 1766797807,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Beyto",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109693147071651645348/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKIFMt_MJJA5IkVOFxZyk3gcTCvMAjsPc4ePiGyRLAgVLZTlg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 months ago",
        "text": "I ordered for the first time and was impressed. The delivery was really fast, the pizza came hot and fresh, and you can tell they use quality ingredients. This might become my go-to pizza place.",
        "time": 1756270097,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Gregory G",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112403941079735527791/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLbzqoZ5RwdHpgVAilYgMbWOICyOvykPNPkzVsI9pOovP3p_Wc=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "Been going to this pizza place for a while. Always delivered great pizza. They just changed their crust recipe and it’s even better!",
        "time": 1764201658,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Liz Potvin",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117446006302534521920/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJXWm02DyUdOVdcCg2TnYkPgHb5lmh0u3Jo1ACv4RJhJkd0wwM=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 years ago",
        "text": "We tried this for the first time and we were very satisfied. The app was down when we wanted to order online, so we called, and the person over the phone was very friendly and helpful with our order. The delivery guy was polite and friendly, their staff were nice to deal with.\nThe pizza is not wet underneath and the amount of ingredients is very well balanced. We are new to the area, and after trying several pizza places, this is our pizza place for future orders.",
        "time": 1582656785,
        "translated": false
